│                          │ false reversals, and (4) a slope-change penalty term so genuine dynamics are preserved    │
│                          │ while spurious direction flips are damped. The crossover combines deterministic           │
│                          │ polynomial fitting (cheap, low latency) with stochastic state estimation (adaptive,       │
│                          │ tracks regime changes), avoiding expensive wavelet/EMD decompositions that add latency.   │
