│                          │ refined pass with the first-pass output, w = clip(1.25 − 1.25·dyn_ratio, 0.10, 1.0). This │
│                          │ blends toward the smoother first pass when the signal is quiet (noise suppression) and    │
│                          │ toward the responsive refined pass when dynamics are strong (lag reduction), targeting    │
│                          │ corr ~0.93 while the Whittaker polish continues to hold false reversals near 14. The      │
│                          │ sigma_acc cap is preserved in the refinement block as a per-sample cap of 1.5·σ_r,        │
│                          │ consistent with the raise.                                                                │
